{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨（22日）晚8時許，警方接獲有人報案，指在深水埗鴨寮街一單位發現住在上址的朋友暈倒。救援人員接報到場，發現一名姓劉（38歲）男子倒臥在上址一客廳，他經救護人員檢查後證實當場不治，男子死因有待驗屍後確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:15:27.259455+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T16:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:08:44.253310+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T16:08:44.253310+00:00","content_hash":"c28bb2a54e1fcf9fd858486eea19a205afdbd909579a1e30f2f470991e0e0e7c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}